<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins mostly $2.00</p>
<p>lower; butts steady; skinned hams 20-26 lbs. weak; seedless</p>
<p>bellies generally steady; lean trimmings 2.00-4.00 higher.</p>
<p>Trading slow to moderate, with light demand and mostly moderate</p>
<p>offerings. - USDA</p>
